/Title (In her study, she developed a multi-step machine learning pipeline using gut microbiome data from stool samples. The approach involved feature selection techniques to zero in on the most informative microbial signatures linked to depression. From there, she trained an AI model, essentially teaching it to spot patterns that distinguish people with major depressive disorder from those without.)
