/Title (Not only did this pipeline screen for major depressive disorder but it also pinpointed potential microbial biomarkers that can differentiate individuals with depression, with an impressive 99% accuracy. It turns out, when it comes to advancing mental health diagnostics, maybe our minds should be in the gutter.)
